{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260601_100021_p29_b17", "persona_id": "db:29", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "1. 当用户要求具体数据时，绝不能复读同一话术，必须提供新信息或补偿方案。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260601_100808"}
